<body>
    <h1>Task Collaboration Practice</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><strong>Before Development:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>senior/junior clarify the task requirement, and discuss implementation; =
both shall be clear about the implementation to code level;</p></li>
<li>
<p>junior provides development schedule, senior reviews the schedule based =
on step1=E2=80=99s discussion; provides both agreed schedule.</p></li>
</ol>
<p>=E5=89=8D=E6=9C=9F=E7=9A=84=E8=A8=8E=E8=AB=96=EF=BC=8Cimplementation=E7=
=9A=84=E7=A2=BA=E5=AE=9A=E5=92=8C=E5=AE=89=E6=8E=92=EF=BC=8C=E6=87=89=E8=A9=
=B2=E6=9C=80=E8=8A=B1=E6=99=82=E9=96=93=EF=BC=8C=E6=98=AF=E6=95=B4=E5=80=8B=
=E9=81=8E=E7=A8=8B=E7=9A=84=E6=A0=B8=E5=BF=83=E3=80=82=E7=B6=93=E9=81=8E=E9=
