=B3=95=EF=BC=8C<strong>=E5=9F=BA=E6=96=BC=E9=96=8B=E7=99=BC=E4=BA=BA=E5=93=
=A1=E7=9A=84=E5=80=8B=E4=BA=BA=E8=83=BD=E5=8A=9B</strong>=EF=BC=8C=E7=B5=A6=
=E5=87=BA=E5=90=88=E7=90=86=E6=99=82=E7=A8=8B=E5=AE=89=E6=8E=92=E3=80=82</p=
>
<p><strong>During Development:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>senior monitors the progress and outcome whether as pre-agreed, the diff=
iculties that happen during development, or new findings; whether need to a=
djust the timeline, if need whether it is acceptable.</p></li>
<li>
<p>junior report to senior about the updates during development, like diffi=
culties, new findings</p></li>
</ol>
<p>=E4=B8=AD=E6=9C=9F=E8=AA=BF=E6=95=B4=EF=BC=8C=E6=9C=89=E7=9A=84=E8=A9=B1=
=E3=80=82</p>
<p><strong>Post Development:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>junior send MR(Before send MR, make sure all code/cases hv been tested, =
target no bugs to be found by qa/senior)</p></li>
</ol>
<p>2. senior final review the MR and merge(review the code quality, if foun=
d bug whether it is acceptable, if not acceptable, let junior know)</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
